    "title": "MICROSERVICE-apiwizdoc-List Hotel Loyalty Points Historys-v3-spec",
    "description": "The Hotel Loyalty Points History Retrieval API allows users to access the detailed history of hotel loyalty points accrued by a customer. This endpoint is designed for hotel management systems and customer service applications, enabling them to fetch information about loyalty points, including transactions, expirations, and adjustments. Typical consumers of this API include hotel staff and loyalty program managers who need to provide customers with account insights or to verify points before bookings. By using this API, businesses can enhance customer experience and streamline loyalty program management.",
